{
  "cards": [
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-001.png",
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "de6a33fe355e4a96897946f88aa67d937d363d04c2a2d3bca706295ded2ed79f",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "The fading summon-light leaves Renna Holt and Mirelle Voss standing\namong the five new arrivals in Niflheim's lobby. No third survivor stands\nwhere Edren Marr had arrived with them."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-002.png",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "809f1e14c0350375cb71032964f8dc4520c6ebc534cfe557455110ae7fa7bb54",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Renna looks from Mirelle's blood-marked sleeve to the empty patch of stone\nwhere Edren fell, then checks her bowstring once."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-003.png",
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "b0263f6f41f3335faaccee08b4fd6999e063a16d29f3b7b290abcb7f114111a4",
      "speaker": "Renna Holt",
      "text": "He’s dead. Your arm is bleeding, Mirelle. Before anyone goes through\nanother gate, that needs tending."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-004.png",
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "eeece234ca8e04e7f502ca97ef844fdf782dffc73f9efdbaf258e814609be6be",
      "speaker": "Mirelle Voss",
      "text": "You’re right. I let that blade through and kept fighting."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-005.png",
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "3d91884960b82a2bce08d155c1ca8dfa725ebdf53b036c20a8f562ba4cc08ade",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Mirelle tears a narrow strip from the repaired cuff, presses it to her bleeding\nupper arm, and offers its loose end toward Renna."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-006.png",
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "e862e16388c2c98eb5fa165e0f9d363de83cf57bb2da258d6cbbf6256855e89b",
      "speaker": "Mirelle Voss",
      "text": "Hold this a breath, please. I’m not calling myself fit just because I’m\nstanding."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-007.png",
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "796a7bb88f5fe6deffe75bf4aa4b094c5048ebfb667b4e58fd76539187ab8e45",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Renna takes the loose end of the cloth and holds it snug against Mirelle's\nupper arm."
    },
    {
      "count": 8,
      "filename": "page-008.png",
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "mime_type": "image/png",
      "sha256": "9bb02950254578b6ac72910883aeb2c7ce8376baac5c0e149e4080d5a68d9ae3",
      "speaker": "Renna Holt",
      "text": "I've got it. Standing isn't the same as fit."
    }
  ],
